Now &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Shark&lt;/color&gt;'s tribespeople are activating a site nearby to harass you.
    
There's &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;a psychic suppressor machine&lt;/color&gt; there tuned to the male gender and &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;2 manhunting goats&lt;/color&gt; are wandering nearby.</text>
