				<li>
					<id>3</id>
					<name>Paula's Cassowaries</name>
					<appearanceTick>1287000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceTick>1288340</acceptanceTick>
					<ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>16659</ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<ended>True</ended>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>1291590</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>3</challengeRating>
					<description>A 36-year-old hunter named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Paula&lt;/color&gt; is calling from nearby. She says (*Threat)a pack of 4 manhunting cassowaries(/Threat) are hunting her!

She begs for safety and offers to join you at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Eden&lt;/color&gt;.

If you accept &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Paula&lt;/color&gt;, the manhunting cassowaries will follow in &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;1 hour&lt;/color&gt;.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Paula&lt;/color&gt; is too frantic to offer more information.</description>
					<root>ThreatReward_Manhunters_Joiner</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
				</li>
				<li>
					<id>4</id>
					<name>Panda's Forced Weather</name>
					<appearanceTick>1324000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceTick>1335046</acceptanceTick>
					<ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>100082</ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<ended>True</ended>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>1335646</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>A 81-year-old low-wage worker named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Azami 'Panda' Berry&lt;/color&gt; is calling for help! He is hiding from a malfunctioning weather control satellite. He wants to flee and join you at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Eden&lt;/color&gt;.

If he joins you, the weather will be rainy thunderstorm for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;9.9 days&lt;/color&gt; until the satellite resets.

Desperate to stay hidden, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Panda&lt;/color&gt; claims to be unable to tell you more about himself.</description>
					<root>ThreatReward_GameCondition_Joiner</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
				</li>
				<li>
					<id>5</id>
					<name>The Deserter</name>
					<appearanceTick>1560000</appearanceTick>
					<ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>0</ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>1960093</cleanupTick>
					<dismissed>True</dismissed>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Constantine Maleinos&lt;/color&gt;, a deserter, is calling from nearby. He has deserted the army of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Exodus Empire&lt;/color&gt; and is being hunted by (*Threat)a loyalty squad(/Threat). He wishes to join you at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Eden&lt;/color&gt;.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Maleinos&lt;/color&gt; knows the location of key outpost containing everything needed to develop psychic powers:

  - Psylink neuroformer
  - Psylink neuroformer

Beware - If you accept &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Maleinos&lt;/color&gt;, you will become an enemy of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Exodus Empire&lt;/color&gt;! The pursuing loyalty squad will attack immediately. It is composed of: 

  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 champion&lt;/color&gt;

Only accept if you wish to fight against &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Exodus Empire&lt;/color&gt; and develop your psycasters on your own. You will have one year to attack the outpost before it is moved.</description>
					<root>Intro_Deserter</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
				</li>
				<li>
					<id>6</id>
					<name>Pig-sitting</name>
					<appearanceTick>1800000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceTick>1809253</acceptanceTick>
					<ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>445740</ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>
					<acceptedBy>Thing_Human1068</acceptedBy>
					<ended>True</ended>
					<endOutcome>Success</endOutcome>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>2469253</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Makarios Palamas&lt;/color&gt;, a baron of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Empire&lt;/color&gt;, is making a request. He wants you to take care of 2 pigs at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Eden&lt;/color&gt; for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;8 days&lt;/color&gt;. The pigs are &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Palamas&lt;/color&gt;'s favorite pets, and he wants them to see the world outside his royal court.</description>
					<root>Hospitality_Animals</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
				</li>
				<li>
					<id>7</id>
					<name>Royal Ascent</name>
					<appearanceTick>2101000</appearanceTick>
					<ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>-60000</ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<challengeRating>4</challengeRating>
					<description>You have learned of a way to escape this planet!

The high stellarch of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Empire&lt;/color&gt; will perform a customary visit with any Count of his domain upon request. Invite him, satisfy his royal needs for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;12 days&lt;/color&gt;, and all of you can ride the shuttle to the Imperial flotilla. You may then join the Imperial court, or escape to a new life among the stars.

Earning the title of Count means completing quests to earn honor with &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Empire&lt;/color&gt;. It may take years to finally achieve the title of Count.

During his visit, you must keep his mood above 25%. This means providing royal perquisites like a lavish bedroom.

Others will take the opportunity to try to kill the high stellarch, and will attack with great intensity. Be prepared to defend.

The high stellarch will bring four of his personal guards and place them under your command. You must house these guards, but the high stellarch will not complain if they are killed or unhappy.

You must keep the visitors at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Eden&lt;/color&gt; and not send them anywhere else. If you fail this quest or migrate, you will have another chance at it later.</description>
					<root>EndGame_RoyalAscent</root>
