					<description>A 31-year-old starship janitor named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Custodio&lt;/color&gt; is calling from nearby. He admits he profaned a peace ritual between &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Trogo Nation&lt;/color&gt; and &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Bomb Terrorists&lt;/color&gt;. Now they are both chasing him!

