If you accept &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Custodio&lt;/color&gt;, both &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Trogo Nation&lt;/color&gt; and &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Bomb Terrorists&lt;/color&gt; will raid you in &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;8 hours&lt;/color&gt;.

